Cell["\<\
Figure 15. Shortest paths = tropical (min-plus) algebra. The Bellman-Ford \
recurrence is a single tropical mat-vec; iterating it to a fixed point gives \
the Kleene star.\
\>", "Text",
 TextAlignment->Center,
 FontFamily->"Helvetica",
 FontSize->11,
 FontSlant->Italic,ExpressionUUID->"793851b0-ec26-4469-bb91-c5785e25491f"],

