Cell["\<\
Figure 7. Five-node weighted digraph and its complete shortest-path distance \
matrix computed as -KleeneStar[-costM].\
\>", "Text",
 TextAlignment->Center,
 FontFamily->"Helvetica",
 FontSize->11,
 FontSlant->Italic,ExpressionUUID->"f668246b-f402-4523-9b10-fcaf65d8eca4"],

Cell["4.  Classical application 2 - project scheduling", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"6c1a88c1-1967-49fb-82c5-c2245e384095"],

Cell["\<\
Suppose n tasks have durations d_i and a precedence DAG (\"task i must finish \
before task j starts\"). The earliest completion time of each task is the \
longest path from any source to that task plus its own duration. That longest \
path is, again, a tropical mat-vec / Kleene star computation.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"74c9c3c2-ea78-44bb-b319-0c7eee08e6a1"],

