Cell["\<\
Figure 16. Newton-polytope duality. Monomials lifted to one dimension higher, \
the upper convex hull, and the resulting tropical polynomial.  In higher \
dimension the upper hull projects to a regular subdivision of input space.\
\>", "Text",
 TextAlignment->Center,
 FontFamily->"Helvetica",
 FontSize->11,
 FontSlant->Italic,ExpressionUUID->"13d4c058-096e-4b31-a443-e934114fce99"],

Cell["\<\
In two variables the same picture holds with the upper hull a 2D-polytope's \
set of facets:\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"3b469a56-49ea-4778-813f-ac49cc57bfb7"],

