Cell["\<\
Figure 9. A small digraph with a dominant cycle 1 -> 2 -> 3 -> 4 -> 1 of \
total weight 10 over length 4. Iterating x_{t+1} = A \[CircleDot] x_t makes \
the mean of x grow at the eigenvalue rate \[Lambda]_max = 2.5 per step.\
\>", "Text",
 TextAlignment->Center,
 FontFamily->"Helvetica",
 FontSize->11,
 FontSlant->Italic,ExpressionUUID->"ca45f084-f69a-46e9-ab4e-f4332f5d3663"],

Cell["7.  ReLU = the tropical sum  0 \[CirclePlus] x", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"c7624963-6712-4e66-b6b7-cb2fa997627d"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Everything above stands on its own. Now we cross over to neural networks. \
The bridge is the observation that ",
 StyleBox["ReLU is the unit operation of the max-plus semiring",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 "."
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"ccfbe93a-2aa5-43ff-9494-88896ab217ce"],

