Cell["\<\
Figure 11. The identity that does all the work, and the four regions of the \
right-hand side over the (A, B) plane.  Each region corresponds to one of the \
four monomials in the tropical product.\
\>", "Text",
 TextAlignment->Center,
 FontFamily->"Helvetica",
 FontSize->11,
 FontSlant->Italic,ExpressionUUID->"f7e9c86f-340c-4c36-8b6c-5dbe49decbf0"],

Cell["9.  Symbolic derivation: 2 -> 1 -> 1 network", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"a003635c-4efc-436a-bbba-e250b37a7cfd"],

Cell["\<\
The smallest non-trivial classifier has 1 hidden unit. Splitting the output \
weight on its sign gives an explicit (P, Q) pair:\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"a5c34322-e040-4662-b4b4-195cc51cab0d"],

